      "Packet v4, receipt v2, and marker v4 are additive structural interfaces and cannot satisfy publication before AIDEV-190 activation.",
      "AIDEV-187 supplies no signing, key custody, replay, primary or recovery authority, readiness, activation, rollback, or break-glass path.",
      "The active v3 workflow, pre-push hook, generator, validators, receipt runtime, schemas, and provenance catalog remain unchanged.",
      "Manual Antigravity Gemini is external-manual and never a Pi provider or model value.",
      "Same-model role assignment is valid; context independence remains unavailable until AIDEV-190.",
      "Every slice uses exact Node 24.14.0, npm 11.13.0, an external base-lock dependency sandbox, immediately preceding-base preflight, and a verified temporary candidate node_modules link; candidate tests remain supporting evidence only.",
      "AIDEV-190 consumes the opaque interface before AIDEV-166 can activate successors."
    ],
